{"schema_version": "small_lecturer_image_teaching/v1", "scenario_id": "image_v1_visual_statistics_open_29", "candidate_idx": 29, "title": "visual_statistics_open (6-2数与形(2))", "grade": "六年级", "question": {"text": "明明和爸爸开车去动物园,画了汽车速度随时间变化情况(曲线:0-2升30,2-8保持30,8-10降0,10-12升30,12-16保持30,16-20降0)。(1)汽车行驶了多长时间?最大速度是多少?(2)出发后8分钟到10分钟可能出现什么情况?【小试牛刀】", "image": {"path": "pqfile_ce99ed9f9b97253cd5eb6c25.jpg", "sha256": "281c73713f3ae8912507fc068a89949c3d593d3e575ff2c192e5bc80384f1c6c"}}, "reference_answer": {"value": "20分钟;30千米/时;停车", "answer_type": "text", "unit": ""}, "bucket": "visual_statistics_open", "visual_dependency": "required", "misconception_seed": "", "difficulty": "medium", "source": {"question_id": "6a631f3d184f723b3592d084", "provider": "pujia_school_question_bank", "lesson_name": "6-2数与形(2)"}, "state": "candidate"}
{"schema_version": "small_lecturer_image_teaching/v1", "scenario_id": "image_v1_visual_statistics_open_30", "candidate_idx": 30, "title": "visual_statistics_open (6-2数与形(2))", "grade": "六年级", "question": {"text": "毕达哥拉斯学派研究了有趣的形数。(1)三角形数(点阵1,2,3,4…n)。数:___ 式:___。(2)选做:五边形数(点阵)。数:___ 式:___。", "image": {"path": "pqfile_99173d9ddc5ef6ecc7b2bbf2.jpg", "sha256": "b16d0d587c5986a0f4efd769a4967b68df3a5d07604af38aef78dbfe2528a53c"}}, "reference_answer": {"value": "三角形数1,3,6,10,15…;T_n=n(n+1)/2;五边形数1,5,12,22,35…;P_n=n(3n-1)/2", "answer_type": "text", "unit": ""}, "bucket": "visual_statistics_open", "visual_dependency": "required", "misconception_seed": "", "difficulty": "hard", "source": {"question_id": "6a631f46184f723b3592d090", "provider": "pujia_school_question_bank", "lesson_name": "6-2数与形(2)"}, "state": "candidate"}
